/T (ArrowDynamics played a total of 12 qualifying matches, with a total win/loss record of 7-5. At the end of the qualification matches, our team was ranked 9th, which while not high enough to give our team the chance to be an alliance captain, it did give us the opportunity to participate in the playoff matches. )
/E (ArrowDynamics played a total of 12 qualifying matches, with a total win/loss record of 7-5. At the end of the qualification matches, our team was ranked 9th, which while not high enough to give our team the chance to be an alliance captain, it did give us the opportunity to participate in the playoff matches. )
