<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 126 0 R
/E (As we prepare for the DCMP \(District Championships\), we are also looking ahead to the FIRST World Championship in Houston, TX, April 29th to May 2nd. Only 21 of 126 teams from the PNW District will be qualified to go Houston based on merit/performance and awards at DCMP. We believe we have a very good chance of being one of those 21 teams, and we are actively preparing now for that possibility.  )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
182 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 126 0 R
/E (One of the largest challenges for a new team, like ourselves, is being able to raise funds for trips to both District Championships and World Championships. Last year we started fundraising with only 1 week to plan and book travel expenses. It cost us more than $35,000 to send 12 students and 3 mentors to Houston, TX. After all the fundraising, each family was asked to cover the remaining balance of $1,200 per each student, a significant amount for our students.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
183 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 126 0 R
/E (This year, we anticipate more than 25 - 30 students who plan to attend the FIRST World Championships in Houston TX at the end of this month. Our estimated costs for these students, mentors and chaperones will be approximately $65,000.  With no funding support, the cost per person will be more than $2,500 for each student. For this reason, we are asking your help in the following ways:)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
